From ccfb9e94c520fff7b82385e6fab5a67843c9e3fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rigaz29 <ryanbagas27@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 15:59:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libhardware: tambahkan display_defs.h untuk HAL display QCOM
 legacy

hardware/qcom-caf/msm8916/display/libhwcomposer/hwc_utils.h:29 meng-include
<hardware/display_defs.h>, tapi berkas itu tidak ada di mana pun di pohon 24.0.
Akibatnya libqdutils gagal:

  hwc_utils.h:29:10: fatal error: 'hardware/display_defs.h' file not found

Berkas ini mendeklarasikan nilai composition type khas QCOM (HWC_BLIT) dan
flag rotasi yang dipakai HAL display pre-UM.

Diambil dari ULH legacy_support_patches lineage-23.2; menerap bersih ke 24.0.
Kegagalan yang sama tercatat sebagai kegagalan build #2 saat porting 23.2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014jmPZUGK9WfRiXSD8axwCp
Change-Id: I14a69c19f934e7ec5baabf2cba4363807eb0d740
---
 include/hardware/display_defs.h     |  1 +
 include_all/hardware/display_defs.h | 79 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 80 insertions(+)
 create mode 120000 include/hardware/display_defs.h
 create mode 100644 include_all/hardware/display_defs.h

diff --git a/include/hardware/display_defs.h b/include/hardware/display_defs.h
new file mode 120000
index 00000000..2660e81c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/include/hardware/display_defs.h
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+../../include_all/hardware/display_defs.h
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/include_all/hardware/display_defs.h b/include_all/hardware/display_defs.h
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..0ec356fe
--- /dev/null
+++ b/include_all/hardware/display_defs.h
@@ -0,0 +1,79 @@
